      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Montecito nestles between the Santa Ynez Mountains and the Pacific Ocean, where onshore breezes keep winters mild and summers cool.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
